    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物关系"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4912,
        "name": "娜布·玛莉卡塔",
        "desc": "<p>花神，大慈树王与赤王的挚友。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/31/59155606/df77c80b17526e9aa7c4e365b369b21d_6115228951106138458.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "娜布•玛莉卡塔创造了灵光，后者之后变成了神鸟，西摩格。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4910,
        "name": "大慈树王",
        "desc": "<p>初代草神，也是智慧之神。娜布·玛莉卡塔与赤王的挚友。为了不让世界树继续遭受禁忌知识的污染，大慈树王从世界树中被彻底抹除。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/31/59155606/283cea7d534af180f1561b619e60e0f7_6776115350797876271.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "大慈树王将灵光变成了神鸟西摩格，令其守护森林。诞生于西摩格的花灵，是大慈树王的眷属。由于大慈树王的相关信息已从",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7087,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "中被抹去，如今花灵被视作",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7471,
        "name": "布耶尔",
        "desc": "<p>须弥的草之魔神</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/27/132559235/eefeae3e6ad6f9081dc2a39d89a720fd_256420061147755822.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的眷属。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4780,
        "name": "厄歌莉娅",
        "desc": "<p>枫丹前代水神，殒殁于500年前的大灾厄中。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/20/a5b8d23dd3fbe0969cc3ebce78f9c29f_8021351765588020911.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在厄歌莉娅死去后，她的身体化为了纯净的甘露。西摩格喝了甘露的水，并散成了许多碎片。从这些碎片中，花灵便由此诞生了。\n西摩格\n一只神鸟，花灵便诞生于它的身躯之中。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7033,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "草神的眷属。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5744,
        "name": "戴因斯雷布",
        "desc": "<p>坎瑞亚末代宫廷卫队的「末光之剑」，蒙受了来自天空岛的不死诅咒。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/06/26/59155606/385d810ab3166799fc6ea831619f5ef6_5129310545559016295.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在灾厄爆发期间，戴因斯雷布曾与最初的花灵，祖尔宛并肩作战。\n旅行者的血亲\n在灾厄暴发期间，血亲曾与最初的花灵，祖尔宛并肩作战。\n矫论团\n矫论团欺骗花灵以获取「灵光绝唱」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 20,
        "name": "旅行者",
        "desc": "从世界之外漂流而来的旅行者，被神带走血亲，自此踏上寻找七神之路。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/04f769b0b1671b5ffbbafefd7286b4b2_8705621070531496665.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "勇者，斯露莎的「谒诵主」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名花灵"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3829,
        "name": "祖尔宛",
        "desc": "<p>祖尔宛是诞生于甘露花海的一只花灵，被认为是最初的花灵。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/10/88072335/0987bc70b51b17406a88efddf714172b_373159445615742976.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "最初的花灵。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3827,
        "name": "斯露莎",
        "desc": "<p>斯露莎是诞生于甘露花海的一只花灵，也是被灵光认可的勇者。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/02/326985891/0f828dc000ea54f3f0ac3bc42eeaa1ea_4255680863916274921.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "被灵光认可的花灵「勇者」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3826,
        "name": "米希尔",
        "desc": "<p>诞生于甘露花海的一只花灵，米希尔是荆棘之眷属。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/17/88072335/e5391d67413dbbaa939883880fe035d0_1568365135425999917.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "荆棘之眷属。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3825,
        "name": "拉沙鲁",
        "desc": "<p>诞生于甘露花海的一只花灵，拉沙鲁是跋尔松之眷属。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/10/88072335/df8cfccb3616e905b16555813e6b0195_2099326314826445257.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "跋尔松之眷属。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3824,
        "name": "瑟法娜",
        "desc": "<p>诞生于甘露花海的一只花灵，瑟法娜是看守净觉花花圃。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/10/88072335/b971abb5511eb82efd51da203a999c4d_8434618369756541487.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "看守净觉花花圃的花灵。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3823,
        "name": "贾尔贾",
        "desc": "<p>诞生于甘露花海的一只花灵，贾尔贾喜欢设计名为「浮光鸣召」的赛道挑战。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/10/88072335/bb411ee24c98ae2de8176fd0003e9335_4267994165835671157.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "设计「浮光鸣召」的花灵。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3828,
        "name": "菲多赫",
        "desc": "<p>诞生于甘露花海的一只花灵，菲多赫是看守甘露池。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/10/88072335/e6c92c89bba136838a50ad3d50f8ef78_2769534760381264740.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "看守甘露池的花灵。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
