        "name": "净光翎",
        "desc": "<p>灵光百种所遗留下来的，凝结着过去记忆的断片。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/18/47826599/5f255b2d4002f92c7cbead86be41238c_9222712888138402298.png",
